##### sponsor-block #####
sponsor_company: AWS
-----
sponsored_text: Strands Agents is a production-ready, open-source SDK from AWS that takes a model-driven approach to building AI agents. Define your agent with a prompt, tools, and a model, and Strands handles the orchestration.
-----
logo_image: strands-wordmark-green-2.svg
-----
