sponsor_company: Meta
-----
sponsored_text: Our products serve more than 3 billion people and we are constantly iterating and developing new technology to connect people all over the world. Our teams use Python every day and we understand how important it is to work with the open-source community to solve problems together and ensure the success of this language for everyone.
