##### sponsor-block #####
sponsor_company: Bloomberg Engineering
-----
sponsored_text: Bloomberg is building the world's most trusted information network for financial professionals. Our 9,000+ engineers are dedicated to advancing and building new systems for the Bloomberg Terminal to solve complex, real-world problems. We trust our teams to choose the right technologies for the job, and, at Bloomberg, the answer is often Python. Our active community of 4,000+ Python developers have their hands in everything from financial analytics and data science to contributing to open source technologies like Project Jupyter and pandas. Bloomberg is a proud Visionary Sponsor of the Python Software Foundation and sponsors many Python community events around the globe. Learn more at <a href=https://www.bloomberg.com/company/values/tech-at-bloomberg/python/>TechAtBloomberg.com/python</a> .
-----
logo_image: bbgengineering-black-2025.png
-----
sponsor_url: https://www.bloomberg.com/company/values/tech-at-bloomberg/python/
