##### sponsor-block #####
sponsor_company: NumFOCUS
-----
sponsored_text: NumFOCUS is a 501(c)(3) that provides critical resources to some of the world's most leveraged and prominent open-source tools. Our work ensures these essential tools remain accessible, sustainable, and free, empowering researchers and professionals worldwide to achieve groundbreaking discoveries and advancements.
-----
logo_image: numfocus-logo-2025.png
-----
sponsor_url: https://numfocus.org/
##### sponsor-block #####
sponsor_company: Talk Python
-----
sponsored_text: Talk Python is the weekly Talk Python To Me podcast plus a deep library of demo-based Python courses. Hear creators and maintainers share how real-world Python gets built, then turn insights into skills with 270+ hours of training on web, data, and automation. We help teams and individuals learn faster and ship better software.
-----
logo_image: talk-python-lightbg.png
-----
sponsor_url: https://talkpython.fm/
